WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.450 --> 00:00:01.628
Hi, and welcome!

2
00:00:01.628 --> 00:00:08.846
I'd love to show you Codexta in an online shop: an AI assistant your customers can simply talk to,

3
00:00:08.846 --> 00:00:12.970
and that looks after them the way your best staff would.

4
00:00:14.420 --> 00:00:17.308
It works with the shop you already run,

5
00:00:17.308 --> 00:00:20.269
follows your policies in plain language,

6
00:00:20.269 --> 00:00:22.120
and keeps you in control.

7
00:00:23.170 --> 00:00:25.608
Sarah is shopping for her son.

8
00:00:25.608 --> 00:00:30.483
Codexta already knows Luka's size and the colours she likes,

9
00:00:30.483 --> 00:00:32.920
so the very first results fit.

10
00:00:33.970 --> 00:00:36.830
One sentence, and it's in her basket.

11
00:00:37.880 --> 00:00:39.829
It suggests what goes with it,

12
00:00:39.829 --> 00:00:43.142
and it notices her style: classic and smart-casual.

13
00:00:43.142 --> 00:00:47.170
It saves that to Luka's profile, so next time it starts there.

14
00:00:48.220 --> 00:00:51.700
Questions get answered straight from your own policies,

15
00:00:51.700 --> 00:00:54.420
like free returns within twenty-eight days.

16
00:00:55.470 --> 00:00:59.474
When something goes wrong, like a promo code that won't work,

17
00:00:59.474 --> 00:01:03.346
Codexta logs it, checks the knowledge base for a known fix,

18
00:01:03.346 --> 00:01:06.300
and opens a support ticket when nothing fits.

19
00:01:07.350 --> 00:01:09.945
And when she'd rather talk to a person,

20
00:01:09.945 --> 00:01:13.938
it hands her over to live chat, with the whole conversation.

21
00:01:13.938 --> 00:01:15.801
Emma picks it up from there,

22
00:01:15.801 --> 00:01:18.330
and Sarah never has to repeat herself.

23
00:01:19.380 --> 00:01:20.579
That's Codexta.

24
00:01:20.579 --> 00:01:24.414
Your shop's customer service, carried out by AI,

25
00:01:24.414 --> 00:01:26.572
with the controls built in.

26
00:01:26.572 --> 00:01:28.170
Thanks for watching!

